(text "INPUTS 1-4: PASSIVE SENSING AND ADC" (at 20 18 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left)) (uuid e72196e6-e6e7-531c-b9e2-cb8a3f36b645))
(text "Two 1M resistors limit input current.\n4.7k returns each ADC input to passive VBIAS.\nNo analog switch or active input clamp.\nInput attenuation also applies without USB power." (at 25 215 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 7c35bd46-bae9-577c-8d68-dd09ac38f267))
(text "470pF filters are on the ADC side.\nNominal attenuation = 426.5319. PGA = +/-1.024V.\nMeasure one live DC pair, other terminals open." (at 230 215 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid d96ae67b-bb51-5caf-9bdd-f2b98b835cd5))
(text "12V nominal; 0-18V intended measurement range.\n48V is a calculation stress, not a survival rating.\nDo not connect any terminal directly to AGND or USB_GND." (at 25 242 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid e6fa3cf3-8049-5e60-a6f4-c8a3bca45668))
)
